[{"title":"中秋有感","author":"刘鹗","text":"京国湖山十二年，年年两地望婵娟。\n流光过客催我老，明月与人今夜圆。\n又逐云萍来岭表，幸同儿女乐尊前。\n可怜有弟头如雪，烂漫斑衣绕膝边。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14783,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"登快阁","author":"刘鹗","text":"一登快阁情何极，太史骑鲸已上天。\n烟树溟濛秋可画，江山空阔客如仙。\n半生不识东南路，浪迹深惭上下船。\n四海故人今聚会，忽惊歌舞落尊前。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14784,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题兴化县严士奇诗卷","author":"刘鹗","text":"盘错载逢知利器，冰霜屡阅见生涯。\n轻车熟路老为县，短什长篇真当家。\n今雨田田饶谷粟，东风处处长桑麻。\n公庭静坐无馀事，閒数梅开第几花？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14785,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送徐伯高","author":"刘鹗","text":"共宦关南三见秋，相看政好又韶州。\n故家乔木今千载，碧嶂清江第一流。\n案牍暇时仍阅史，江山佳处更登楼。\n如今刀笔皆为相，好取功名趁黑头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14786,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送李子洁巡按","author":"刘鹗","text":"十载相违一见君，何堪岁晏又轻分。\n南风十日不成雪，一雨满山都是云。\n滑滑长途宜自重，萧萧孤驿不堪闻。\n周原郡邑咨询遍，为吊斯民志独勤。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14787,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵","author":"刘鹗","text":"节序匆匆又落花，几回沧海叹乘槎？\n不闻庭竹来鸣凤，祇见宫槐噪晚鸦。\n老去可怜心转赤，悲来那觉鬓生华？\n明当拂袖江南好，山雨晴时笋正芽。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14788,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"奉别瑞甫高掾郎还南台","author":"刘鹗","text":"岭海屡惊来诏使，蛮方孰不仰皇都？\n自怜老去难为别，但有人来莫惜书。\n乘兴何妨吟萼棣，思归应不为莼鲈。\n台端历历陈时弊，十道疲民未得苏。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14789,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"有怀蒙泉都帅二首 其一","author":"刘鹗","text":"讨贼提兵垂十稔，老成练达亦吾师。\n竖儒几败乃公事，男子要为天下奇。\n公瑾孤军鏖赤壁，谢玄劲气破淮肥。\n从渠百万终为贼，要取梅关却赋归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14790,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"有怀蒙泉都帅二首 其二","author":"刘鹗","text":"卜式助边常百万，如斯乃可济时艰。\n传家自有遗经笥，报国无忘拜将坛。\n满眼黄金轻似土，他年清节重如山。\n广东未必真忘我，但有官鹾定拨还。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14791,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"韶州围城","author":"刘鹗","text":"浩劫如天似未涯，生民性命等飞花。\n兵戈轇轕动万计，柴米从容有几家？\n宇宙岂应将拆裂？\n英雄到此谩咨嗟。\n忠肝义胆难磨灭，自昔睢阳世共誇。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14792,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"枕上偶成","author":"刘鹗","text":"常思为国致升平，每事参差谩有情。\n天魔未除难学道，国粮不足莫论兵。\n痛怜劫运如长夜，起视明星近五更。\n待得朝廷消息好，笑携儿子赋归耕。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14793,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"答胡海翁、胡宗性重谒","author":"刘鹗","text":"悠然无语眄庭柯，风雨伤春奈若何！\n浮世周旋如子少，馀情流丽向人多。\n好诗寄我频三诵，穷巷经年一再过。\n无酒固难淹李白，空馀文燄照松萝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14794,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"来诗","author":"刘鹗","text":"暖云扶绿上林柯，春去春来可奈何！\n远道尘泥行客少，故园风雨落花多。\n撷兰溪上心非隐，种柳庄前足怕过。\n尚意玉堂青眼旧，肯嫌俗驾忤烟萝？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14795,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雪罢，小立二首 其一","author":"刘鹗","text":"风吹树枝雪，片片点人衣。\n尘浊有清意，半因忙失之。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14796,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雪罢，小立二首 其二","author":"刘鹗","text":"呼童清晓起，扫却门外雪。\n日出消作泥，惟恐涴幽洁。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14797,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题罗斗明","author":"刘鹗","text":"离别本来最苦，相逢正值高秋。\n肠断扁舟难挽，烦君细问安流。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14798,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄旧友张汉杰二首 其一","author":"刘鹗","text":"几度思君欲白头，凄然常隐去年秋。\n此心恨杀中澪水，不向栖霞楼畔流。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14799,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄旧友张汉杰二首 其二","author":"刘鹗","text":"双凤堂前日往来，东坡池上几徘徊？\n遥知尊酒相逢处，风雨凄凉半是苔。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14800,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"九日峡江舟中","author":"刘鹗","text":"秋风如此客辞家，重理平生旧帽纱。\n不是故山无白酒，年年奔走负黄花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14801,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"仙茅","author":"刘鹗","text":"风雨凌空一叶飞，师生邂逅即天机。\n山林小草知何限？\n汝独神仙得所依。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14802,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"秋山图","author":"刘鹗","text":"石田荒尽豆苗稀，素化为缁尚未归。\n不是此山无好景，草心正欲报春晖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14803,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"清明有感","author":"刘鹗","text":"花开如雨柳如烟，风景虽奇节序迁。\n儿女不知春渐晚，隔墙犹自弄鞦韆。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14804,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"杨花","author":"刘鹗","text":"如雪纷纷不自持，殷勤长藉好风吹。\n莫欺此日飘零甚，犹有为萍变化时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14805,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"城南饮归","author":"刘鹗","text":"无分骑驴趁早朝，城南饮散雪初销。\n北风吹酒忽成醉，梦里行过第二桥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14806,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题东山高卧图","author":"刘鹗","text":"东山携妓嬉游日，敢意胸存万甲兵。\n今日总戎真竖子，徒耽歌舞误苍生。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14807,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄士彦佥宪十绝 其一","author":"刘鹗","text":"城郭荒村处处同，五羊楼观倚晴空。\n时平若建麒麟阁，更画何人第一功？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14808,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄士彦佥宪十绝 其二","author":"刘鹗","text":"训练精兵捷若神，从渠百变日如云。\n向来诸葛今何似？\n青眼高歌独望君。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14809,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄士彦佥宪十绝 其三","author":"刘鹗","text":"世祖成宗德业深，百年培植士如林。\n登车揽辔平生志，孝子忠臣万古心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14810,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄士彦佥宪十绝 其四","author":"刘鹗","text":"情好虽亲音问疏，秋来眠食近何如？\n因风敢致平安问，谩折梅花当寄书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14811,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄士彦佥宪十绝 其五","author":"刘鹗","text":"绿章夜奏玉皇家，八载奇勋信可誇。\n待得九重丹诏下，共君握手看梅花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14812,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄士彦佥宪十绝 其六","author":"刘鹗","text":"自别京华意惘然，浮云过眼十三年。\n白头太守成何事？\n又促乘骢瘴海边。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14813,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄士彦佥宪十绝 其七","author":"刘鹗","text":"会稽山与白云齐，海阔谁怜雁过稀？\n犹幸峤南天气暖，免教游子叹无衣。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14814,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄士彦佥宪十绝 其八","author":"刘鹗","text":"更无钱可叹空囊，杜老何从籴太仓？\n共说羊城饶贮蓄，山中尚有禹馀粮。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14815,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄士彦佥宪十绝 其九","author":"刘鹗","text":"帝王曾此理薰弦，尚觉遗音满耳边。\n若使闻韶仍大嚼，绝胜骑鹤更腰缠。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14816,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄士彦佥宪十绝 其十","author":"刘鹗","text":"萧萧木叶落穷冬，倦客翛然况味同。\n珍重孤根如铁石，少须明日又东风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14817,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题应玚三入承明图","author":"刘鹗","text":"安车三度入承明，七子诗应让老成。\n好是衣冠遗泽远，诸孙犹自负廉声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":14818,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题聂侯所